* @title Array-backed input reversal
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Appendix D, Solution 1.5
* @input >>>
* 5
* ONE
* TWO
* THREE
* FOUR
* FIVE
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* FIVE
* FOUR
* THREE
* TWO
* ONE
* <<<
          &TRIM = 1
          A = ARRAY(INPUT)
          I = 1
READ      A<I> = INPUT :F(PRINT)
          I = I + 1 :(READ)
PRINT     I = I - 1
          OUTPUT = A<I> :S(PRINT)
END
